usage: log-mindthus-runtime.py [-h] [--repo-root REPO_ROOT]
                               [--marketplace-root MARKETPLACE_ROOT]
                               [--cache-root CACHE_ROOT]
                               [--codex-home CODEX_HOME] [--json] [--strict]

Log Mindthus repo, marketplace, and Codex cache runtime fingerprints.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --repo-root REPO_ROOT
                        Mindthus repository root.
  --marketplace-root MARKETPLACE_ROOT
                        Installed local marketplace plugin root.
  --cache-root CACHE_ROOT
                        Codex plugin cache root.
  --codex-home CODEX_HOME
                        Codex home directory.
  --json                Emit machine-readable JSON.
  --strict              Exit 1 on missing tracked files, missing markers, or
                        hash mismatch.

Runtime boundary: status=ok verifies installed files, hashes, and marker
presence only. It does not prove model behavior, semantic judgment quality, or
runtime activation correctness.

